  "shortDescription": "Pixel-art look for 3D scenes: low-res render, Bayer dither, palette reduction, depth outline, supersampling, soft highlights.",
  "version": "4.2.0",
  "description": [
    "Post-process shader (Three.js) that renders the 3D scene at low resolution with dithering, color quantization, depth-based outlines, vignette and chromatic aberration.",
    "Call 'Install pixel 3D effect' once at the start of the first scene, then tweak settings with the other actions."
  ],
  "tags": [
    "3d",
    "pixel",
    "dither",
    "shader",
    "post-processing"
  ],
